{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルのサイト見たら\n2幕の登場人物のイラストが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい！素敵！興奮した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの気になる人物は誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から5月です。\n公演ももうすぐです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしメンバー内で風邪が\n流行っている...予防しなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼若月"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/30/3117013/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/30/3117013/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眉だけじゃないけど眉すきだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}